# Screenshots the agents produce while testing.
#
# Ignored because they are evidence for one run, not project files.
#
# They live under .claude/ rather than anywhere else in the tree because the
# repo root is also the Godot project root: a .png sitting in the project gets
# imported as a texture and shows up as project churn. .claude/.gdignore fences
# this whole directory from the importer.
*
!.gitignore
